## Astro Islands (Interactive Components)
Use islands ONLY when interactivity is needed. Default to plain HTML.

```astro
---
// Astro island — loads JS only for the interactive part
import GameComponent from '../components/games/GameComponent';
import ScoreForm from '../components/games/ScoreForm';
---

<!-- Static content — no JS -->
<h1>Snake Game</h1>
<p>Score: {topScore}</p>

<!-- Island — loads React/Vanilla JS only here -->
<GameComponent client:load />

<!-- Lazy island — loads when visible -->
<ScoreForm client:visible />
```

**Island directives — choose correctly:**
| Directive | When to Use |
|---|---|
| `client:load` | Critical interactive UI (game canvas) |
| `client:visible` | Below-fold interactive elements |
| `client:idle` | Non-critical interactive elements |
| `client:only="vanilla"` | Component that only runs in browser |

> Prefer vanilla JS over any framework for simple interactivity.
> Games can use vanilla JS/Canvas — no framework needed.

