## Routing Rules
| Pattern | Example | Type |
|---|---|---|
| Static page | `src/pages/about.astro` | SSG |
| Dynamic slug | `src/pages/blog/[slug].astro` | SSG with `getStaticPaths` |
| API endpoint | `src/pages/api/scores.ts` | Server endpoint |
| Auth redirect | `src/pages/profile.astro` | SSR (needs middleware) |

- API endpoints live in `src/pages/api/` and export `GET`, `POST` etc.
- SSR pages need `export const prerender = false` or global `output: 'server'` in config
- Never expose sensitive data in SSG pages — they are public static files

